<title>SPAIN: Spain's Pryca 6-month sales down 1.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Pryca 6-month sales down 1.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish hypermarket group Pryca gross sales were 270.65 billion pesetas in the six months to June, a fall of 1.6 percent from the same period a year earlier, the firm said on Friday.</p>
<p>In June alone, sales were 44.45 billion pesetas compared with 46.3 billion pesetas in May.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
